{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"“The day before we were meant to leave, the ship got attacked by a summoner makes Solomon. He attempted to kill himself by turning to stone. Rahvioli, Astella, someone else I don’t remember, and I all brought him out of the water and turned him back to flesh. Astella beheaded him, and he turned back to snow. He dropped an amulet that had the symbol of the ‘Golden Dawn’. His dead body then turned to snow”","created_at":"2020-07-27T04:37:12.024000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737166678395191316","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"Copper pauses\n“Now fast forward in time. Yesterday our ship got tangled up in seaweed. I went out with some people to clear it out. In the seaweed, I found a message in a bottle. I brought it inside. Goanne and I brought it to Wynne to have it read. Wynne said it was meant for Castor. This created a debate, that involved many people. In the end I took the contract back and left to room.”","created_at":"2020-07-27T04:37:21.160000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737166716714352672","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"He pauses again.\n“Later in the day, Castor comes to my room. And I explained the barebone basics of the what happened that day. Goanne was outside my room listening to the entire conversation. After our talk, Ebuc entered my room asking to see what the thing I found was. That’s when Castor left Ebuc and I alone. I then asked Ebuc to meet me alone in Room 15.”","created_at":"2020-07-27T04:37:30.425000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737166755574579261","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"He pauses again.\n“I then left a note on Leafs bed warning her that I might be in Room 15. Then I met Ebuc. Before I had the chance to show him the contract, Castor came into the room with Rahvioli and Amara. Saying that Wynne needed to talk to me. So we left and went into Castors room, leaving Rahvioli and Amara outside his door. After which, Castor told me that he fears there are bad people afoot. So we went to my room to keep Leaf from going on her own.”","created_at":"2020-07-27T04:37:39.365000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737166793071656970","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"He pauses again.\n“In my room Castor tells us that we have to be wary of Web, Goan, and Ebuc. Then Castor left my room. Leaf and I knew we had to protect the contract. So I took the bottle that original held it. Then I took paper and made 3 scrolls to all look the same, and mixed them up with Leaf. The intention is to not have anyone know where the original is.”","created_at":"2020-07-27T04:37:47.777000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737166828354142289","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
