{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"He pauses again, “after which Wynne came to talk to us. The next morning I awake and dicosver that Rahvioli is dead.And that  is the extent of my knowledge that relates to all of this.”","created_at":"2020-07-27T04:38:25.153000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737166985120579625","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
